WEBVTT

00:00:02.590 --> 00:00:05.790
Is the online island the result of someone's thinking?

00:00:05.830 --> 00:00:06.950
Yes, it is.

00:00:07.030 --> 00:00:09.820
That is why time can be repeated many times.

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:13.790
With the invocation of the sword of the Fourth Progenitor, a disturbance can be generated.

00:00:13.790 --> 00:00:14.790
Isn't that so?

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:17.280
But that doesn't make sense.

00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:20.200
On the online island there were around 6000 inhabitants.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:22.590
That is why she was necessary.

00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:23.190
What?

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:26.080
Kasugaya-san's blood is needed for that.

00:00:26.180 --> 00:00:29.180
Maybe it can be called "Nanoshikigami".

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:35.190
With the size of a virus and a complex system, it was able to retain magic.

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:40.960
With it's power, the online island was maintained with a barrier, blocking the communications of the world.

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:42.390
I see.

00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:45.320
So the reason Himeragi speared me that time ...

00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:46.030
Yes.

00:00:46.430 --> 00:00:52.150
I infiltrated myself in order to destroy the Nanoshikigami you had in place.

00:00:53.430 --> 00:00:58.070
Who and for what reason used that to create the online island?

00:00:59.230 --> 00:01:02.940
The quickest would be to ask that person himself.

00:01:06.470 --> 00:01:07.830
Magatoki Kako.

00:01:08.270 --> 00:01:10.200
Also known as the Ouma witch.

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:13.480
She was part of Elsiyou's strenght.

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:15.670
The great teacher of science.

00:02:50.160 --> 00:02:53.160
Why is someone from Elsiyou showing up right now.

00:02:53.280 --> 00:02:54.520
Is it revenge?

00:02:55.870 --> 00:02:59.790
The reason I caught you on the online island was because of a part-time job.

00:02:59.990 --> 00:03:02.340
At the request of a certain person.

00:03:02.440 --> 00:03:03.540
Who?!

00:03:03.580 --> 00:03:07.080
I can not tell you. It is the sponsor's rule.

00:03:07.260 --> 00:03:10.480
You have it hard, Akatsuki Kojou-kun.

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:12.640
Could you go back to the island?

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:14.950
So you can earn money?

00:03:15.020 --> 00:03:17.060
You should have limits!

00:03:18.070 --> 00:03:22.800
There are still 6,000 prisoners on the online island.

00:03:22.840 --> 00:03:25.120
Will you let them die?

00:03:25.230 --> 00:03:26.070
What?!

00:03:26.160 --> 00:03:31.700
If it is still under the influence of magic, it will soon be destroyed.

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:36.150
Since in order to maintain the island, a lot of magic is required.

00:03:36.460 --> 00:03:37.670
For example ...

00:03:38.220 --> 00:03:41.190
The heart of a vampire.

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:45.880
Were they using Kojou as a magical enery source?!

00:03:45.880 --> 00:03:48.310
It was not idea to offer it as a sacrifice.

00:03:48.640 --> 00:03:50.960
The purpose was as follows,

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:53.720
You and Kojou had to get to know each other,

00:03:53.720 --> 00:03:57.520
and combining your heart with his, you would start a new source of energy.

00:03:59.640 --> 00:04:06.900
As a result, the barrier could have been maintained for another 12 years.

00:04:07.030 --> 00:04:13.630
Ah, although there is aslo the possibility that the other girls help Kojou create more lives-

00:04:13.630 --> 00:04:14.600
Don't fuck with me!

00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:15.420
Yes!

00:04:15.420 --> 00:04:17.160
Senpai is right.

00:04:17.280 --> 00:04:20.120
Oh, I thought it would be a good idea,

00:04:20.180 --> 00:04:22.120
What kind of a good idea would that be?

00:04:22.120 --> 00:04:26.640
From the beginning, why did it occur to you to lock up so many people on that island?!

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:29.300
If they free those people, the problem would be solved instantly.

00:04:29.560 --> 00:04:31.660
That idea is denied.

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:35.580
The creator of the online island does not what that.

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:36.840
Creator?

00:04:37.550 --> 00:04:42.220
That means if we defeat him, we can save the people of the island, right?

00:04:43.080 --> 00:04:45.620
If you can pass over me ...

00:04:46.100 --> 00:04:47.720
Sekkarou!

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:55.160
You and that spear are dangerous. You shoud be quiet for a moment.

00:04:55.320 --> 00:04:57.100
Himeragi Yukina.

00:05:00.140 --> 00:05:01.150
Himeragi!

00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:03.620
Oh no!

00:05:03.680 --> 00:05:05.230
Launch that!

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:06.240
It's understood.

00:05:07.710 --> 00:05:10.990
Good, everything went as I wanted.

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:12.220
What?

00:05:12.270 --> 00:05:16.840
I wanted to see that face of yours, Kojou.

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:23.660
Kojou! Kojou!

00:05:23.950 --> 00:05:26.220
Open your eyes, Kojou!

00:05:27.840 --> 00:05:29.240
Kasuko?

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:35.820
Damn it! That damn teacher ...

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:38.660
Another time she dragged us to the online island.

00:05:39.380 --> 00:05:43.400
Well, but this time we didn't lose the memories.

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:48.220
So we were always deceived by her.

00:05:48.390 --> 00:05:49.500
Don't worry.

00:05:49.800 --> 00:05:52.870
It is not your fault that you have been deceived.

00:05:53.680 --> 00:05:56.190
Don't make me get used to this!

00:05:56.190 --> 00:05:58.190
I'm not depressed or anything like that.

00:05:58.230 --> 00:05:59.470
Then it's okay.

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:01.080
Let's go.

00:06:01.150 --> 00:06:02.320
Where?

00:06:02.390 --> 00:06:05.520
To defeat the creator of the online island,

00:06:06.390 --> 00:06:08.120
and free this island.

00:06:08.390 --> 00:06:11.640
To the creator of the online island ...

00:06:12.320 --> 00:06:14.110
Do you have any idea where he might be?

00:06:14.590 --> 00:06:17.860
Perhaps that "creator" is ...

00:06:18.230 --> 00:06:19.840
... Kasugaya Shinako.

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:21.150
Kasugaya?

00:06:21.520 --> 00:06:25.120
She was the one who gave me my last name.

00:06:25.670 --> 00:06:30.080
Since I did not know the faces or names of my parents,

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:33.420
I have an idea where she may be.

00:06:34.300 --> 00:06:38.140
Inside this island there is a place where nobody can enter,

00:06:38.140 --> 00:06:41.200
and it is also protected against beasts.

00:06:41.470 --> 00:06:44.630
If Shinako has to be somewhere, I'm sure it's there.

00:06:44.630 --> 00:06:46.190
So that's where she is.

00:06:50.260 --> 00:06:53.150
Whatever it is, it's not letting us get close.

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:56.670
It seems that our assumption was correct.

00:06:57.510 --> 00:06:58.790
Get back, Kasuko.

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:01.900
I will do it.

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:08.340
Kojou?!

00:07:18.840 --> 00:07:21.760
Are you awake, Himeragi Yukina?

00:07:24.990 --> 00:07:27.340
Who are you?

00:07:27.700 --> 00:07:29.470
The Blood.

00:07:29.520 --> 00:07:31.780
They call me the king of vampires.

00:07:32.100 --> 00:07:34.520
Although I added "king" myself.

00:07:35.400 --> 00:07:42.700
Here this is the underground part of the online island.

00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:47.000
I'm glad you were invited here.

00:07:47.120 --> 00:07:50.580
Are you the sponsor of the Ouma witch?

00:07:50.580 --> 00:07:54.990
The one who used a Nanoshikigami and brought Akatsuki-senpai here.

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:56.790
Nanoshikigami?

00:07:57.280 --> 00:08:00.900
Oh, The Nano-automation.

00:08:01.310 --> 00:08:05.220
I wanted to destroy him.

00:08:05.220 --> 00:08:06.600
Destroy?

00:08:07.660 --> 00:08:14.190
Before he causes trouble because of his kindness.

00:08:15.240 --> 00:08:18.540
I won't let you do what you want, The Blood!

00:08:18.870 --> 00:08:21.880
Are you planning to save Kasugaya Shizuri?

00:08:23.110 --> 00:08:27.510
So, I will warn you before you proceed to what your heart says.

00:08:27.740 --> 00:08:30.040
You cannot save her.

00:08:30.470 --> 00:08:33.230
Of course neither Akatsuki Kojou.

00:08:33.900 --> 00:08:34.910
What?

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:40.270
Kasugaya Shinako?

00:08:40.990 --> 00:08:42.310
She's dead.

00:08:42.760 --> 00:08:45.630
Also, for a long time.

00:08:45.840 --> 00:08:48.360
Say this to Akatsuki Kojou:

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:53.040
"Hate me. Fear the name of The Blood."

00:08:53.040 --> 00:08:55.380
Wait there, The Blood!

00:08:57.560 --> 00:09:00.760
See you soon, Himeragi Yukina.

00:09:02.180 --> 00:09:05.560
Until the day you fall.

00:09:11.800 --> 00:09:14.940
An attack? Lui-san, why?

00:09:15.270 --> 00:09:17.950
Kojou! Hold on, Kojou!

00:09:18.670 --> 00:09:20.520
It was obvious.

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:23.230
He wouldn't let me go.

00:09:23.340 --> 00:09:24.750
But I'm glad.

00:09:24.760 --> 00:09:25.430
Eh?

00:09:25.640 --> 00:09:28.180
I don't know if he revived or what,

00:09:28.180 --> 00:09:30.700
but he's alive.

00:09:31.100 --> 00:09:32.120
Kojou ...

00:09:34.110 --> 00:09:34.980
Kenjuu!

00:09:36.080 --> 00:09:38.460
I can't believe that even you ...

00:09:39.230 --> 00:09:40.670
Get down!

00:09:43.230 --> 00:09:44.470
Nina-san?

00:09:44.470 --> 00:09:47.160
Kojou, at this rate we ...

00:09:47.160 --> 00:09:48.320
I got this.

00:09:49.160 --> 00:09:52.120
Come, Natra Cinereus!

00:09:56.580 --> 00:09:59.320
A vampire ability ...

00:09:59.350 --> 00:10:03.110
So this is the power of the Fourth Progenitor, huh?

00:10:05.630 --> 00:10:08.230
With this we will save a little time.

00:10:09.700 --> 00:10:13.920
So, why do we stay here?

00:10:14.580 --> 00:10:17.400
I couldn't think of another palce to rest.

00:10:17.600 --> 00:10:20.830
Well, let's leave it like this.

00:10:20.940 --> 00:10:23.400
Here we can recover.

00:10:24.660 --> 00:10:27.120
I am a little more relieved.

00:10:32.670 --> 00:10:33.460
Why?

00:10:33.940 --> 00:10:36.400
It's what the creator decided, huh?

00:10:36.960 --> 00:10:40.040
He doesn't seem to want to let us drift away.

00:10:41.420 --> 00:10:43.430
I get tired!

00:10:47.480 --> 00:10:49.200
Hey, Kasuko! You ...

00:10:52.820 --> 00:10:54.150
What are you doing?

00:10:54.710 --> 00:10:58.720
Th-That's what you did with Kamikiba-senpai.

00:11:02.070 --> 00:11:05.040
Are you asking me to suck your blood?

00:11:05.140 --> 00:11:07.510
A-Are you disagreeing?

00:11:07.780 --> 00:11:14.030
It is true that compared to her my breasts are small and I have no experience.

00:11:14.070 --> 00:11:18.310
Well, I'd be surprised if you had experience because of how you look.

00:11:19.070 --> 00:11:22.430
I-I don't mean that kind of experience!

00:11:22.520 --> 00:11:23.560
Oh, no.

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:26.140
I don't mean to be a virgin.

00:11:26.140 --> 00:11:28.950
Of course, I have no experience in that either ...

00:11:30.660 --> 00:11:32.990
D-Die!

00:11:32.990 --> 00:11:35.710
You brought up the subject yourself!

00:11:41.310 --> 00:11:42.220
Please.

00:11:43.420 --> 00:11:48.670
I have nothing else to offer you.

00:11:49.830 --> 00:11:52.680
I know I'm saying something selfish ...

00:11:53.430 --> 00:11:57.460
But please lend me a little more your power.

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:07.580
Where are you palying?!

00:12:08.240 --> 00:12:10.820
These horns are beautiful.

00:12:10.820 --> 00:12:14.150
They are as smooth as a finger.

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:17.720
Don't touch there.

00:12:17.780 --> 00:12:22.590
When you do that my magic is altered.

00:12:27.420 --> 00:12:31.300
Don't say those things if you want me to lend you my power.

00:12:31.740 --> 00:12:34.040
We are already involved.

00:12:34.420 --> 00:12:37.950
We are going to defeat that teacher's and save everyone.

00:12:52.350 --> 00:12:54.920
Thanks, Kojou.

00:13:03.980 --> 00:13:06.870
Don't tell everyone.

00:13:06.900 --> 00:13:09.750
Oh, about your virginity-

00:13:09.750 --> 00:13:14.700
No, I mean our ... "love".

00:13:14.870 --> 00:13:16.310
I will not say.

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:19.680
Still, Kasuko. You had nice underwear.

00:13:21.100 --> 00:13:22.520
I'll kill you!

00:13:22.520 --> 00:13:24.100
Idiot, wait!

00:13:24.100 --> 00:13:25.710
This is not the time!

00:13:25.710 --> 00:13:26.920
Then what is time?!

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:28.980
Look around!

00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:33.070
General Hokurayama.

00:13:34.280 --> 00:13:39.340
It seems they are all together.

00:13:49.820 --> 00:13:51.430
Kojou, that!

00:13:52.540 --> 00:13:55.080
You two! So you were fine!

00:13:57.030 --> 00:13:59.460
Were you also transported here?

00:14:00.870 --> 00:14:06.470
We are very concerned with how you could survive on this island.

00:14:06.470 --> 00:14:10.300
Hey! How many problems do you think I faced before coming here?!

00:14:10.500 --> 00:14:13.160
Stil, what was that smoke?

00:14:13.340 --> 00:14:17.470
I call it "ANN". It is an Anti-Nanoshikigami Nanoshikigami.

00:14:17.660 --> 00:14:21.000
It is a nanoshikigami created to face another nanoshikigami.

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:28.640
As a presentation, I can say that based on the original Shikigai of this island, I was able to recreate a version to face it.

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:31.300
We also use this in the infirmary.

00:14:32.190 --> 00:14:36.110
Is the reason we didn't lose our memories being brought here because of that?

00:14:36.220 --> 00:14:37.560
Yes, maybe.

00:14:37.560 --> 00:14:41.740
But with only this it will be impossible to save all the people on the online island.

00:14:41.880 --> 00:14:44.080
We don't have a complete idea of nanoshikigami yet,

00:14:44.160 --> 00:14:47.700
so it's somewhat different than magic-created nanoshikigami.

00:14:47.910 --> 00:14:52.800
So as a result, we can only fight.

00:14:52.800 --> 00:14:56.460
If it's about that, then it's my turn.

00:14:57.070 --> 00:14:59.940
Yuuma? So you are fine too.

00:15:00.150 --> 00:15:03.080
It will be thanks to the anti-nanoshikigami node.

00:15:03.230 --> 00:15:08.070
With my current power, we can fight in this world.

00:15:08.270 --> 00:15:10.740
Then we should go to the place, right?

00:15:10.820 --> 00:15:11.620
Perhaps.

00:15:12.500 --> 00:15:13.220
Well.

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:15.640
It's okay.

00:15:15.760 --> 00:15:18.910
So we are going to leave now.

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:22.860
If we are going to destroy this world, we have to prepare from the outside, right?

00:15:23.030 --> 00:15:23.940
I entrust that to you.

00:15:24.260 --> 00:15:25.420
Yuuma.

00:15:29.200 --> 00:15:35.360
All your friends are strong and incredible people.

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:36.900
I do not know.

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:40.360
But they will also be your friends.

00:15:40.520 --> 00:15:42.440
When we return to the other world.

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:47.220
I hope that is possible.

00:15:48.510 --> 00:15:49.590
Come on, Kojou.

00:15:50.020 --> 00:15:51.620
The truth awaits us.

00:15:56.660 --> 00:15:58.380
This is the Karukeri end point.

00:15:58.740 --> 00:16:00.110
Karukeri, huh?

00:16:00.380 --> 00:16:02.740
It means prison in italian, doesn't it?

00:16:03.020 --> 00:16:04.000
Prison?

00:16:04.320 --> 00:16:05.660
Yes.

00:16:06.230 --> 00:16:08.920
The prisoners are inside the prison.

00:16:09.360 --> 00:16:11.120
Professor Magatoki.

00:16:11.790 --> 00:16:13.900
I told you that you can call me Kako-chan.

00:16:14.380 --> 00:16:21.510
Shut up, you fucking teacher!
You're the one who controls everything, huh?

00:16:21.510 --> 00:16:23.510
They were orders from the sponsor.

00:16:23.590 --> 00:16:28.060
Everything to make you despair, Akatsuki Kojou.

00:16:28.060 --> 00:16:29.460
Make me despair?

00:16:29.700 --> 00:16:31.300
You will not remember it,

00:16:31.300 --> 00:16:34.600
but it is not the first or the second time that you lose companions.

00:16:34.670 --> 00:16:40.480
Those events of despair are marked in your soul.

00:16:40.860 --> 00:16:43.080
All related against the world.

00:16:43.940 --> 00:16:50.080
Is that the only reason why you used the online island?

00:16:50.360 --> 00:16:53.860
But it is a pity. The online island is already at its limit.

00:16:54.260 --> 00:16:57.800
That is why I will grant you your last despair.

00:16:58.030 --> 00:17:00.600
True despair.

00:17:00.990 --> 00:17:01.950
Come here.

00:17:12.880 --> 00:17:16.340
That attack is just like Hawless.

00:17:16.430 --> 00:17:20.540
I will introduce you to the creator of the online island.

00:17:20.840 --> 00:17:24.360
The real Kasugaya Shizuri Castiella.

00:17:25.160 --> 00:17:28.440
The real me?

00:17:28.750 --> 00:17:33.620
It wasn't Shinako. Am I the true creator?

00:17:34.910 --> 00:17:37.830
Doesn't it surpise you, Akatsuki Kojou?

00:17:38.300 --> 00:17:41.920
I see. You sucked Kasugaya-kun's blood.

00:17:42.230 --> 00:17:46.780
The result of this prison is the dreams that the creator sees.

00:17:47.070 --> 00:17:52.060
Your exist within your dream, False Paladiness.

00:17:52.400 --> 00:17:55.120
Your existence is false.

00:17:55.520 --> 00:17:57.520
Not only you.

00:17:57.660 --> 00:18:01.310
All humans within the online island are false.

00:18:05.820 --> 00:18:10.740
You don't accept the truth of not being able to save Kasugaya Shinako.

00:18:11.080 --> 00:18:14.400
That is why you created your own demonic clan.

00:18:14.750 --> 00:18:19.300
Using Hawless magic.

00:18:19.680 --> 00:18:24.680
But that is already over. Kasugaya Shizuri Castiella will disappear.

00:18:27.430 --> 00:18:30.830
Being killed by herself.

00:18:32.020 --> 00:18:33.380
Don't fuck with me!

00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:38.760
I well remember the despair of losing my own friends.

00:18:38.980 --> 00:18:41.510
But it is not only that brought me here!

00:18:42.270 --> 00:18:45.580
Kasuko's kindness, meeting her friends,

00:18:45.910 --> 00:18:49.100
the trainings we had together. It was all fun.

00:18:52.310 --> 00:18:53.320
Nya!

00:18:53.400 --> 00:18:56.040
Do not be sad!

00:18:56.780 --> 00:19:00.590
Your body may be a fake created with magic.

00:19:00.590 --> 00:19:03.670
But you are the only Kasugaya Shizuri I knew!

00:19:03.870 --> 00:19:05.620
No one can deny that!

00:19:07.030 --> 00:19:10.310
As much as you are a false existence that exists within her dream.

00:19:10.480 --> 00:19:14.160
How can you explain that you are alive?

00:19:14.660 --> 00:19:19.710
You should be more proud to have formed something with the people created in this world.

00:19:20.580 --> 00:19:27.180
I will kick the butt of those people who want to make you fell stupid despair.

00:19:32.920 --> 00:19:36.580
Come on, let's get started, stupid teacher.

00:19:36.780 --> 00:19:39.780
From here is my fight!

00:19:42.440 --> 00:19:45.220
You're wrong, senpai! It is our fight!

00:19:45.220 --> 00:19:47.620
Himeragi, you are late!

00:19:47.790 --> 00:19:50.640
Sorry I was late getting out of there.

00:19:51.470 --> 00:19:54.060
This time I am also a little angry.

00:19:54.350 --> 00:19:59.020
Because of the fact that they took my eyes off reality and brought you here.

00:19:59.480 --> 00:20:03.760
Because of creating a false reality and because they hurt you.

00:20:03.920 --> 00:20:08.580
And for continuing to cheat Kasugaya-san!

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:09.960
Sekkarou!

00:20:13.510 --> 00:20:16.880
People here are not evil spirits.

00:20:16.880 --> 00:20:21.220
They are people like Kasugaya-san who have continued to dream here.

00:20:21.760 --> 00:20:25.300
What Kasugaya-san did was not in vain.

00:20:25.520 --> 00:20:30.670
She saved all of these people as the Paladiness of Mirage.

00:20:32.840 --> 00:20:34.900
It is true.

00:20:35.140 --> 00:20:38.620
As much as I am in a dream, I am me.

00:20:39.160 --> 00:20:43.120
I'm tired of still sleeping.

00:20:43.200 --> 00:20:48.100
It is time for me to defeat you.

00:20:50.180 --> 00:20:53.310
And this was becoming a good experiment ...

00:20:53.480 --> 00:20:55.280
... It look like it failed.

00:20:56.110 --> 00:20:58.590
Well, I will go.

00:20:58.700 --> 00:21:02.100
Even if I say that, you won't let me run away.

00:21:13.920 --> 00:21:15.510
What is this magic?

00:21:15.580 --> 00:21:16.860
Day and night.

00:21:17.520 --> 00:21:20.680
Life and death.

00:21:21.000 --> 00:21:27.620
Everything in this world is being controlled by the witch of Ouma. Its her true power.

00:21:27.910 --> 00:21:29.830
You know very well.

00:21:29.830 --> 00:21:32.230
That's right, Blue Witch.

00:21:32.750 --> 00:21:34.500
Clipse Q!

00:21:35.320 --> 00:21:36.480
Himeragi!

00:21:36.480 --> 00:21:38.550
I got this. You protect Yuuma.

00:21:41.380 --> 00:21:47.190
Come here! Mesarthim Adamas! Al-Nasl Minimum! Dabih Crystallus!

00:21:52.820 --> 00:21:54.140
Sekkarou!

00:21:59.260 --> 00:22:01.470
Did it dodge my attack?

00:22:02.880 --> 00:22:08.380
Yuuma-san, the sword that Ouma witch can surely control time.

00:22:08.380 --> 00:22:10.110
Does she control time?

00:22:10.360 --> 00:22:12.360
I see time magic.

00:22:20.840 --> 00:22:25.380
A teleportation, huh?
A simple copy of Profesor Minamiya.

00:22:25.630 --> 00:22:28.420
Do you think you can catch me with that?

00:22:29.030 --> 00:22:33.100
I will not deny that it is a copied power. But you are wrong.

00:22:33.360 --> 00:22:37.000
The true owner of my power is not Profesor Minamiya.

00:22:37.380 --> 00:22:43.020
It is Tokoyogi Ayasa. Magatoki Kako!
Thanks for showing me your magic book!

00:22:45.140 --> 00:22:46.740
Magic Book?

00:22:46.800 --> 00:22:47.760
I see!

00:22:48.270 --> 00:22:50.600
You are the daughter of the witch of Notaria!

00:22:50.880 --> 00:22:54.900
Oh no. Now you can overcome my magic of time.

00:22:57.390 --> 00:23:00.780
I ask this wish as the bearer of Takagami no Kennagi.

00:23:00.780 --> 00:23:04.980
Having the wisdom and grace required.

00:23:05.640 --> 00:23:07.960
Let me use the sacred power!

00:23:15.990 --> 00:23:20.040
Come, Regulus Aurum!

00:23:27.950 --> 00:23:30.310
It's over, disgusting teacher.

00:23:32.910 --> 00:23:35.590
It's time for you to wake up, Shizuri.

00:23:36.200 --> 00:23:39.820
This will be the light that will cut our darkness.

00:23:40.150 --> 00:23:43.160
A fire that will burn the magic.

00:23:43.220 --> 00:23:47.920
A snake that received fire and be reborn.

00:23:48.160 --> 00:23:50.260
This is the duty of this sword.

00:23:58.680 --> 00:23:59.670
Kasuko.

00:24:01.940 --> 00:24:04.300
I win.

00:25:42.900 --> 00:25:44.060
Hi.

00:25:44.790 --> 00:25:46.670
Do you have any problem?

00:25:46.670 --> 00:25:47.780
Y-Yes.

00:25:47.870 --> 00:25:51.950
I'd like you to tell me how to get a drink from here.

00:25:52.200 --> 00:25:54.720
It gets complicated for you, huh?

00:25:54.880 --> 00:25:56.500
What dou you want to drink?

00:25:58.710 --> 00:26:00.750
Eh? Have you been sleeping for 6 years?

00:26:00.750 --> 00:26:03.460
Yes. I recently wake up.

00:26:03.540 --> 00:26:05.100
I see.

00:26:05.280 --> 00:26:09.840
The truth is that I have a friend who is still sleeping in this hospital.

00:26:09.840 --> 00:26:12.140
But thanks, now I have hope.

00:26:12.230 --> 00:26:17.230
Do not worry. I was saved by a precious friend.

00:26:17.300 --> 00:26:19.470
Ah, do you like him?

00:26:19.600 --> 00:26:23.840
N-No! I would not like him ...

00:26:23.940 --> 00:26:27.230
It is true that at that moment I let him touch me, but ...

00:26:27.230 --> 00:26:29.630
That was because he had to.

00:26:29.800 --> 00:26:32.390
EH? That uniform is ...

00:26:32.860 --> 00:26:37.100
It is the school uniform that I will attend.

00:26:37.200 --> 00:26:39.790
It's the best school, supposedly ...

00:26:39.790 --> 00:26:41.600
Really? What year will you go to?

00:26:41.600 --> 00:26:44.560
I-I'm already in third grade.

00:26:45.400 --> 00:26:48.680
I see. Then I am older than you.

00:26:48.940 --> 00:26:51.320
My name is Akatsuki Nagisa. It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:26:51.390 --> 00:26:52.800
A-Akatsuki?

00:26:53.160 --> 00:26:56.500
Btw, I have been intrigued for a log time.

00:26:56.500 --> 00:26:58.500
Can I touch your horns?

00:26:58.560 --> 00:26:59.120
What?

00:26:59.270 --> 00:27:02.910
Please! Only a little!

00:27:05.670 --> 00:27:09.000
For starters, you have to accomodate this.

00:27:09.070 --> 00:27:11.840
Then these 3 cases.

00:27:12.000 --> 00:27:15.470
And also all these documents. I hope you can memorize them.

00:27:15.640 --> 00:27:16.760
Hey, Asagi-san.

00:27:16.840 --> 00:27:20.000
I just got back from vacation.

00:27:20.270 --> 00:27:22.000
Yes, then?

00:27:22.120 --> 00:27:25.660
Don't come at me with that!
Why are there so many papers?

00:27:25.700 --> 00:27:30.710
I just had two weeks! There should be at least 10! Do you want me to die?!

00:27:30.710 --> 00:27:33.350
You were the one who wanted to rest!

00:27:33.420 --> 00:27:35.270
It was necessary!

00:27:35.270 --> 00:27:37.820
Right, Himeragi? You also say something.

00:27:37.940 --> 00:27:42.520
I'm only mean to watch over you.

00:27:43.340 --> 00:27:44.750
Hey, Kojou!

00:27:45.280 --> 00:27:48.510
I heard about the online island, uh ...

00:27:48.550 --> 00:27:50.070
What is this environment?

00:27:50.240 --> 00:27:54.020
Ah, did they find out that you sucked Kasugaya-chan blood?

00:27:55.080 --> 00:27:56.150
Idiot, don't talk!

00:27:56.310 --> 00:27:59.630
But you had no other choice. It was a hopeless situation.

00:27:59.680 --> 00:28:03.120
Oh, yes. It was desperate situation.

00:28:06.110 --> 00:28:10.280
But with this now you have another younger girl.

00:28:10.700 --> 00:28:12.140
What do you mean?

00:28:12.220 --> 00:28:20.030
Kasugaya-chan was asleep for 6 years, so she should be 20.

00:28:20.180 --> 00:28:22.000
But then if she's young ...

00:28:22.520 --> 00:28:27.680
Well, Astarte wouldn't count and Glenda wouldn't either ...

00:28:27.800 --> 00:28:32.880
Kojou, you are sucking the blood of all girls ...

00:28:33.070 --> 00:28:36.820
Yes. You are a filthy pervert.

00:28:36.920 --> 00:28:40.030
Come on, you still have a lot of work.

00:28:40.150 --> 00:28:44.060
More will come next week, so you don't have time.

00:28:44.150 --> 00:28:48.140
All the information about the online island and other case are still missing.

00:28:48.180 --> 00:28:53.400
Also you need to prepare other files and those that will continue to accumulate if you don't continue.

00:28:53.440 --> 00:28:56.750
You won't be able to eat or sleep until you're done with it.

00:28:56.790 --> 00:28:59.070
Rest assured, Aiba-senpai.

00:28:59.070 --> 00:29:01.820
I will take responsibility and watch over him.

00:29:02.100 --> 00:29:04.680
Give me a break ....
